# Build outputs.
result
result-*

# direnv's materialized profile. The `.envrc` is tracked; what it builds is not.
/.direnv/

# Local agent state (Claude Code worktrees, scratch, settings.local.json):
# never part of the tree. The project settings carry the SessionStart hook
# every cloud session needs (SPEC C27), so that one file is tracked.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
